      "text": "(e) Restart capability\n  (1) Means to restart any APU in flight must be provided.\n  (2) An altitude and airspeed envelope must be established for in-flight APU restarting, and the APU must have a restart capability within that envelope. (See AMC 25B903(e)(2).)",
